Z||000005||gkozlov||07-14-2000||09:09 PM||||Majik,<BR>Actually the car runs great. It has a new Grooms 2.8. Its not much to look at though. As far as the spoiler, I hate it. I would take it of but I dont have a factory spoiler to replace it with. <BR>The sub is a Altec Lansing 6.5in PC sub. It hits real hard for a such a small woofer. I like it because it already has a built in amp. It was a super easy install. <BR>Thanks for your comments. gkozlov||||reg||1
Z||000006||gkozlov||07-14-2000||09:12 PM||||Formula, They very well could be related. Id say mine would have to be the ugly duckling.<BR>gkozlov ||||reg||1
Z||000007||gkozlov||07-14-2000||09:15 PM||||The stripes would be nice if the previous owner would have cared enouph about the car to at least wash it and keep it looking nice. The seat covers are a great fit and look great for the price. As you can see mine had fog lights also. The brackets are still there. They were busted and inop so I took them off. gkozlov<P>||||reg||1
Z||000008||Formula||07-14-2000||09:50 PM||||It looks like it needs a little exterior tlc, but overall its not too bad looking.  btw....I have those seat covers and that steering wheel (mines grey inside though) in my car.  They have to be related. Just on an off note would you mind measuring the width of those stripes.  I want to most likely get 2 8" stripes, the ones on your car seem a little wide to go on mine (formulas look smaller because of the nose).  but I would apreciate it if you get a chance.  I also like how the stripes end in the back, it makes it look almost factory from behind.||||reg||1
