Z||000018||webbee||07-17-2000||04:03 PM||||A note on sticker removel. If you use lighter fluid (naptha) you can safely remove stickers. Flood the edges, start at the corner and slowly peel while flooding the glue the sticker will come off, with out removing the paint. The paint may be brighter under the sticker due to sun fade. You can also use googone but it costs more.<p>[This message has been edited by webbee (edited 07-17-2000).]||||reg||1
